<sect1 id="group___math_constants_1math_constants">
<title>数学常量定义</title><para>根据 ISO/IEC 10967-2 和 IEEE 754，提供以下高精度常量：</para>
<para><table rows="8" cols="4"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>常量  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>符号  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>值（高精度）  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>说明  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>EULER  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>e  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>2.71828182845904523536  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>自然对数的底  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>PI  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>π  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>3.14159265358979323846  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>圆周率  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>PHI  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>φ  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>1.61803398874989484820  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>黄金分割比  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>TWO_PI_HI  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>2π  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>6.28318530717958647692  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>2π 高位部分（用于精确归约）  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>TWO_PI_LO  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>-  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>2.44929359829470641435e-16  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>2π 低位部分（补偿）  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>MACHINE_EPSILON  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>ε  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>取决于 <ref refid="group___core_types_1ga3e85271b70b4968c07a1ed54e119182a" kindref="member">decimal_t</ref>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>机器精度（最小正数差）  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>DEFAULT_TOLERANCE  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>-  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>1e-12  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>默认数值容差  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
</sect1>
